    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Get By Paging",
      "description" : "Retrieves a paginated list of tools from the tool registry. This operation enables efficient data slicing by returning a subset of registered tools based on the specified page number and page size, making it suitable for handling large datasets.\n\nInput Parameters:\npage (number): Page number to retrieve (typically starts from 1).\npageSize (number): Number of tools to return per page.\n\nOutput Parameters:\ntools (array): List of tools from the registry for the requested page.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails.\ntotalCount (integer): Show the total count of tools."
    },
